sequenceDiagram
    participant Cliente
    participant Compras as compras-service
    participant Consul
    participant Core as core-service

    Cliente->>Compras: GET /api/tesoreria/compras/ping/{proveedorId}
    Compras->>Consul: resolver tesoreria-core-service
    Consul-->>Compras: instancia de core
    Compras->>Core: GET /api/tesoreria/core/proveedor/{proveedorId}
    Core-->>Compras: proveedor
    Compras-->>Cliente: 200 ProveedorResponse
